`EmptyLibrary` has `role="region" aria-labelledby` with hardcoded id — only one instance. OK.

17. **library-view.tsx** - `LibraryBody` renders `<Toolbar>` only when there are recordings. Sort select: fine.

Hmm — `NativeSelect` `onChange` — `SORTS.find(option => option.value === event.target.value)`. Fine.

`ToggleGroup value={[controls.layout]}` and `onValueChange` — when the user toggles off the current item, `next` might be empty → layout null → ignored. OK.

18. **local-recordings-screen.tsx** - Key focus-management logic. Let me scrutinize:

```js
useEffect(() => {
    if (previousHash.current === hash) return; // first render, or no change
    previousHash.current = hash;
    const current = resolveRecordingsView(hash);
    if (current.kind === "detail") returnItem.current = current.id;
