}, [duration]);
```

Setting `video.currentTime` for an unseekable stream throws? In Chromium, setting currentTime on a MediaRecorder WebM without duration may not throw, just no-op. OK.

`toggleFullscreen` — `document.fullscreenEnabled` check; `region.requestFullscreen()` — fine.

`videoEvents` object recreated each render — passed as spread props, fine.

