```

Check: identities [A, B] → "A and B". [A, B, C] → rest=[C], rest.length+1 = 2 → "A and 2 others". Correct (B and C are the 2 others). OK.

`requestErrorText`: switch on error.code covering three codes — if the union has more codes, TS exhaustive check would complain. Assume complete.

